<li id="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8-target"><p>Kobolds of Golarion pg. 21 <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8">↩</InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.2" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.2">↩<sup>2</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.3" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.3">↩<sup>3</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.4" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.4">↩<sup>4</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.5" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.5">↩<sup>5</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.6" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.6">↩<sup>6</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.7" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.7">↩<sup>7</sup></InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.8" data-hash-target to="ability-ranger_traps-fake-fn-8.8">↩<sup>8</sup></InnerLink></p></li>
